{"symbol":"GMT.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:50:34Z","info":{"address1":"Bierutowska Street 57-59","address2":"WROCLAW BUSINESS PARK 3","city":"Wroclaw","zip":"51-317","country":"Poland","website":"https://www.genomtec.com","industry":"Medical Devices","industryKey":"medical-devices","industryDisp":"Medical Devices","sector":"Healthcare","sectorKey":"healthcare","sectorDisp":"Healthcare","longBusinessSummary":"Genomtec S.A. researches and develops a mobile point of care genetic testing platform for the clinical diagnostics market in Poland. The company's flagship project is the Genomtec ID, a diagnostic platform that enables the detection of pathogens, such as viruses, bacteria, and fungi, as well as genetic mutations through the analysis of biological material of patients using swabs, urine, and saliva. It also develops SNAAT chemistry for mutation detection in oncology. In addition, the company develops and commercializes tests used in the detection of viral infectious diseases and other areas. Genomtec S.A. was founded in 2016 and is based in Wroclaw, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":32,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Miron  Tokarski Ph.D.","title":"Co-Founder, CEO & Member of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Michal  Wachowski","title":"CFO & Member of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Lee  Huntley","title":"CTO & Member of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Henryk  Roguszczak M.Sc.","title":"Co-founder & Chief Designer","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Malgorzata  Malodobra-Mazur","title":"Co-founder and Director of Research & Development","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":4,"previousClose":2.445,"open":2.375,"dayLow":2.35,"dayHigh":2.49,"regularMarketPreviousClose":2.445,"regularMarketOpen":2.375,"r